le:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:hover:bg-accent/50 size-5 text-white hover:bg-transparent hover:text-gold" aria-label="Search"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></button></div><button class="text-white transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="hidden items-center space-x-6 lg:flex"><div class="max-w-full sm:max-w-[540px]"><button data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:hover:bg-accent/50 size-5 text-white hover:bg-transparent hover:text-gold" aria-label="Search"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></button></div><a class="mr-6 rounded-md bg-gold px-4 py-2 text-sm text-dark transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-gold/90 hover:shadow-lg" href="https://markets.abaxx.exchange">Login</a><a class="rounded-md bg-gradient-to-r from-red-bright to-abaxx-red px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md" href="/resources/start-trading">Start Trading</a></div></div></header><main class="relative mt-14 grow sm:mt-16"><div><div class="relative -mt-14 flex bg-dark sm:-mt-16 min-h-[200px] sm:h-[400px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-dark/35 to-dark/25"></div><img alt="Clearing Membership" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="size-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://abexcws.directus.app/assets/691e05c1-2047-4f5b-acb2-27e8fc8bfca4?v=1758913380504"/></div><div class="container-custom relative z-10 flex w-full flex-1 flex-col justify-between py-8"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center"><div class=""><h1 class="mb-0 text-2xl !leading-[1] font-black text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">Clearing Membership</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg !leading-[1.4] text-neutral-200 sm:text-xl">Review the eligibility criteria and regulatory requirements for firms seeking to become direct Clearing Members of Abaxx Clearing.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="container-custom"><hr class="w-full border-t-[1px] border-divider-light"/></div></div><div><section class="py-12" style="background-color:#FAFAFA"><div class="container-custom"><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 sm:gap-12 lg:flex-row"><div class="w-full max-w-[552px]"><h3 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Membership Requirements</h3><div class="text-component text-neutral-600"><p>To be considered for Clearing Membership, applicants must meet the following criteria:</p>
<ul>
<li>Hold a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license for dealing in capital markets products, or be a bank licensed in Singapore</li>
<li>Maintain base capital or net head office funds of at least S$5 million (or S$1 million if operating under a relevant restricted CMS license)</li>
<li>Contribute to the Guaranty Fund as required</li>
<li>Meet the Monetary Authority of Singapore's fit and proper criteria</li>
<li>Be in good standing, with relevant industry experience</li>
<li>Satisfy creditworthiness criteria established by the Clearing House</li>
<li>Maintain adequate policies, procedures, systems, and internal controls to supervise clearing-related activities</li>
<li>Demonstrate sufficient financial, operational, compliance, and risk management resources to support clearing operations</li>
</ul></div></div><div class="relative w-full max-w-[552px]"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="w-full rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-gradient-from via-dark-gradient-via to-dark-gradient-to p-8 shadow-lg"><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gold">Apply for Membership</h3><p class="mb-6 text-white">Prospective applicants are invited to initiate the registration process. Following the completion of our registration form, a representative from Abaxx Clearing will be in touch to provide further guidance.</p><p class="mb-6 font-bold text-gold">No membership fees apply.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-dark transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-gold-light" href="/resources/start-trading">Register Now<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><div class="container-custom"><hr class="w-full border-t-[1px] border-divider-light"/></div></div><div><div class="container mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-4 py-10 md:max-w-[1280px] md:px-12 lg:px-16"><div class="space-y-6 text-left"><div class="text-component text-neutral-600 mb-6"><p>Applicants seeking to become members of Abaxx Clearing must satisfy the membership criteria outlined in Chapter 2 of both Exchange &amp; Clearing Rules at the time of their application and continue to meet these requirements as long as they remain Clearing Members.</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="bg-gradient-to-b from-dark via-dark-nav to-dark-deep text-white"><div class="container-custom px-8 pt-16 pb-8 sm:px-16"><div class="mb-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><div><div class="mb-4"><img alt="Abaxx Exchange" loading="lazy" width="120" hei